From a861f8c6a5ca4e80440d4793c14ce479d2380167 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 21:42:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] Seer: show how much space the music takes and cap it

The sidebar shows the library size and free disk space. Admins set a limit
there; past it (or below Seer.MinFreeSpace free) new requests are refused
with 507 and queued ones fail with "storage limit reached".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

